    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.15
  m_Text: "<b>1. PROTECT THE HOUSE</b>\nZombies march down 4 roads (East, North,
    West, South) to attack the House.\n\n<b>2. SURVIVE ALL WAVES</b>\nDefeat all
    zombie waves to advance:\n  * Round 1: <i>Daylight</i>\n  * Round 2: <i>Cloudy
    Fog</i>\n  * Round 3: <i>Night Terror</i>\n\n<b>3. DEFEAT CONDITION</b>\nIf House
    HP reaches <b>0%</b>, game is lost!"
