  m_Text: "<b>PEASHOOTER (100 Sun)</b>\n  Fires straight-line peas at horde.\n\n<b>SNOW
    PEA (175 Sun)</b>\n  Chills and slows enemy march.\n\n<b>SUNFLOWER (50 Sun)</b>\n 
    Generates bonus Sun currency.\n\n<b>SUN ORBS (+25)</b>\n  Walk over floating
    Sun to claim!\n\n<b>HERO COMBAT (35 DMG)</b>\n  Chop zombies slipping past plants!"
